{
  "id": "12",
  "title": "伤官说",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“伤官说”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官若伤尽，却喜见官星。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-2a8ee9d83300cbb091a6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官若论财，见祸不轻来。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-9a623f3b5e79a2326850-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官若用印，剋杀不如刑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-d43cb0a7d93812e88784-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官若论财，带合有声名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-681b0d17eeeee553648b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官用财，不宜印乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-3e34787bd44eaf0eabda-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官见官，印运不妨。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-7878cf03b9bd213c7970-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杂气财官，印俱不忌。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-4847a9f7fdf05a2e515e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "两戊合一癸，得再嫁。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-0972e8f22d8b5e0cc7b1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "妻财受剋，生子不育。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-5680001a68289c84ace3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬比肩，不忌财乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-fa4a9c673ffe6b2edcec-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬多根，身旺必贫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-b0683bd05e0cc42e1ef9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬被伤，剋父母。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-50fa28800e02097ba609-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官杀混杂，剋父母。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-af58be3e90f977e0ae55-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财多身弱，剋父母。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-404858e106a73aae7f28-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "干与支同剋妻。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-440ca6208121b96076fe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛卯、戊寅不怕杀多。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-0b3bd4c7bec589a659b4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "女命比肩，即姊妹贪合，多谎诈。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-44687f216dfea5fc9680-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财有劫，不怕露就杀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-cd435262f1e249a1851c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "火命人最好，月支属火，干头有木提出火矣！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-b1f63b66bad6570d5bdb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸酉弱格，见杀必凶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-7c97224b5dfcb4f18bb7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官贵太盛，旺处必倾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-f40a16626d85ab1e2c9f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "土命不论胞胎，只论日时，不怕官杀混杂；阳干方论，阴干不取。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-38964180612105573e3f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "子怕寅午火，不怕水。寅木不怕金。巳金不怕火。己土不怕木。午火不怕水。未同申金不怕水。己土戌土不怕木。卯木怕酉金。辰土怕寅木。乙日五月不怕杀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-1fb3660f86daff9a4338-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱元有病，要去病；不去病不发。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "12-fb2f718e6ee53837869f-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
